@startuml Wiqaytna_Pro_Sequence_Reminder
!theme plain
title Wiqaytna Pro - Automated SMS Reminder Sequence Diagram

participant "Scheduler\n(Spring @Scheduled)" as Scheduler
participant "AppointmentService" as Service
participant "AppointmentRepository" as AppointmentRepo
participant "UserRepository" as UserRepo
participant "SMSService" as SMSService
database "PostgreSQL\nDatabase" as DB
actor Patient

== Scheduled Task Execution (Every Hour) ==

note over Scheduler
  @Scheduled(cron = "0 0 * * * *")
  Runs every hour to check
  for upcoming appointments
end note

activate Scheduler
Scheduler -> Service: sendUpcomingReminders()
activate Service

note right of Service
  Business logic:
  Send reminders for appointments
  scheduled in next 24 hours
  that haven't been reminded yet
end note

Service -> AppointmentRepo: findUpcomingAppointmentsWithoutReminder()
activate AppointmentRepo

AppointmentRepo -> DB: SELECT a.*, d.*, p.*, u_p.*, u_d.*\nFROM appointments a\nJOIN doctors d ON a.doctor_id = d.id\nJOIN patients p ON a.patient_id = p.id\nJOIN users u_p ON p.user_id = u_p.id\nJOIN users u_d ON d.user_id = u_d.id\nWHERE a.appointment_date = CURRENT_DATE + INTERVAL '1 day'\nAND a.reminder_sent = FALSE\nAND a.status IN ('SCHEDULED', 'CONFIRMED')
activate DB

DB --> AppointmentRepo: List of appointments needing reminders
deactivate DB

AppointmentRepo --> Service: List<Appointment> (with patient & doctor info)
deactivate AppointmentRepo

== Process Each Appointment ==

loop For each appointment

  Service -> Service: buildReminderMessage(appointment)

  note right of Service
    Message template:
    "Rappel Wiqaytna Pro:
    Rendez-vous demain {date} à {time}
    avec Dr. {doctorName}
    Cabinet: {address}
    Pour annuler: {link}"
  end note

  Service -> SMSService: sendSMS(phoneNumber, message)
  activate SMSService

  alt Mock Implementation (Development)
    SMSService -> SMSService: logToConsole(phoneNumber, message)
    note right of SMSService
      Console output:
      ================================
      [SMS MOCK] Sending to: +212661234567
      Message: "Rappel Wiqaytna Pro:
      Rendez-vous demain 15/01/2026 à 11:00
      avec Dr. Bennani (Dentiste)
      Cabinet: 15 Rue Allal Ben Abdellah, Rabat
      Pour annuler: http://wiqaytna.ma/cancel/abc123"
      Sent at: 2026-01-14 14:00:00
      ================================
    end note
    SMSService --> Service: Success (mocked)

  else Production Implementation (Future)
    SMSService -> SMSService: Call external SMS API\n(e.g., Octopush)
    note right of SMSService
      POST to SMS Provider API
      with authentication and
      message payload
    end note
    SMSService --> Service: Success/Failure response
  end

  deactivate SMSService

  alt SMS sent successfully
    Service -> AppointmentRepo: updateReminderSent(appointmentId, true)
    activate AppointmentRepo
    AppointmentRepo -> DB: UPDATE appointments\nSET reminder_sent = TRUE,\nupdated_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\nWHERE id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> AppointmentRepo: Updated
    deactivate DB
    AppointmentRepo --> Service: Success
    deactivate AppointmentRepo

    note right of Service
      Appointment marked as reminded
      Won't be processed again
    end note

  else SMS sending failed
    Service -> Service: logError(appointmentId, error)
    note right of Service
      Error logged for retry
      reminder_sent remains FALSE
      Will retry in next cycle
    end note
  end

end

Service --> Scheduler: Reminder batch completed
deactivate Service

Scheduler -> Scheduler: Schedule next execution (1 hour later)
deactivate Scheduler

== Patient Receives SMS ==

note over Patient
  Patient receives SMS
  24 hours before appointment
end note

Patient -> Patient: Reads SMS reminder
Patient -> Patient: Prepares for appointment

alt Patient wants to cancel
  Patient -> "Frontend\n(React)": Click cancel link in SMS
  note right of Patient
    Link opens cancellation page
    in Wiqaytna Pro frontend
  end note
end

@enduml
